 "insight": [
  "The top 5 categories of products imported from Belgium in 2025 are vehicles and parts, mineral fuels and oils, pharmaceutical products, rubber and articles thereof, and machinery and mechanical appliances.",
  "Total imports from Belgium amount to 7.54 billion euros in 2025.",
  "Vehicles and parts are the largest category with 1.58 billion euros, representing 20.9% of imports, followed by mineral fuels and oils at 1.12 billion euros or 14.9%.",
  "The top 3 import categories together account for 45.2% of the total imports from Belgium.",
  "The data values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, and 1.7% of the import value is confidential and shown separately."
 ],
